Chastity	KEY:Domain Power ~ Chastity	CATEGORY:Domain	TYPE:Domain Power	SOURCEPAGE:p.1356	DESC:Once per day, you may dispel a single spell effect targeting you as a targeted dispel magic spell. Caster level equals your character level.
Chastity	KEY:Domain Spells ~ Chastity	CATEGORY:Domain	TYPE:Domain Spells	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Chastity=1|Shield of Faith|Chastity=2|Restoration (Lesser)|Chastity=3|Magic Vestment|Chastity=4|Spell Immunity|Chastity=5|Break Enchantment|Chastity=6|Interposing Hand|Chastity=7|Repulsion|Chastity=8|Antimagic Field|Chastity=9|Mind Blank	DESC:Domain spells: 1 Shield of Faith; 2 Restoration, Lesser; 3 Magic Vestment; 4 Spell Immunity; 5 Break Enchantment; 6 Bigby's Interposing Hand; 7 Repulsion; 8 Antimagic Field; 9 Mind Blank
Chromatic Dragon	CATEGORY:Domain	TYPE:Domain	SOURCEPAGE:p.1356	DESC:Choose a chromatic dragon color. You cannot later change the kind of dragon. Once per day, you may use a breath weapon similar to the chosen dragon's. This breath weapon deals 1d6 points of damage per five cleric levels you possess. A successful Reflex save (DC 10 + 1/2 your cleric level + your Charisma modifier) halves the damage. A black breathes a 60-foot line of acid, a blue breathes a 60-foot line of electricity, a green breathes a 30-foot cone of acid, a red breathes a 30-foot cone of fire, and a white breathes 30-foot cone of cold.|!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Remove Domain Power (Chromatic Dragon)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Domain Power ~ Chromatic Dragon|!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Remove Domain Power (Chromatic Dragon)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Domain Spells ~ Chromatic Dragon
Chromatic Dragon	KEY:Domain Power ~ Chromatic Dragon	CATEGORY:Domain	TYPE:Domain Power	SOURCEPAGE:p.1356	DESC:Choose a chromatic dragon color. You cannot later change the kind of dragon. Once per day, you may use a breath weapon similar to the chosen dragon's. This breath weapon deals 1d6 points of damage per five cleric levels you possess. A successful Reflex save (DC 10 + 1/2 your cleric level + your Charisma modifier) halves the damage. A black breathes a 60-foot line of acid, a blue breathes a 60-foot line of electricity, a green breathes a 30-foot cone of acid, a red breathes a 30-foot cone of fire, and a white breathes 30-foot cone of cold.
Chromatic Dragon	KEY:Domain Spells ~ Chromatic Dragon	CATEGORY:Domain	TYPE:Domain Spells	SPELLLEVEL:DOMAIN|Chromatic Dragon=1|Cause Fear|Chromatic Dragon=2|Gust of Wind|Chromatic Dragon=4|Fear|Chromatic Dragon=6|Symbol of Fear|Chromatic Dragon=9|Weird	DESC:Domain spells: 1 Cause Fear; 2 Gust of Wind; 3 Claws of Darkness; 4 Fear; 5 Rebuking Breath; 6 Symbol of Fear; 7 Aura of Terror; 8 Stunning Breath, Greater; 9 Weird
Emotion	CATEGORY:Domain	TYPE:Domain	SOURCEPAGE:p.1357	DESC:Your understanding of the mind and emotions allows you to more easily shrug off the effects of mind-affecting spells and effects. You gain a +4 bonus on Will saves to resist mind-affecting spells and spell-like abilities.|!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Remove Domain Power (Emotion)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Domain Power ~ Emotion|!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Remove Domain Power (Emotion)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Domain Spells ~ Emotion
Emotion	KEY:Domain Power ~ Emotion	CATEGORY:Domain	TYPE:Domain Power	SOURCEPAGE:p.1357	DESC:Your understanding of the mind and emotions allows you to more easily shrug off the effects of mind-affecting spells and effects. You gain a +4 bonus on Will saves to resist mind-affecting spells and spell-like abilities.	TEMPBONUS:PC|SAVE|Will|4	TEMPDESC:Will saves against mind-affecting spells and spell-like abilities
