Temperance	CATEGORY:Domain	TYPE:Domain	SOURCEPAGE:p.1361	DESC:When you prepare spells you immediately heal 1 hit point per spell level of domain spells you still have prepared from the previous day. For example, if you did not cast your 2nd-level and 4th-level domain spells the previous day you heal back 6 hit points when preparing your spells.|!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Remove Domain Power (Temperance)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Domain Power ~ Temperance|!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Remove Domain Power (Temperance)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Domain Spells ~ Temperance
Temperance	KEY:Domain Power ~ Temperance	CATEGORY:Domain	TYPE:Domain Power	SOURCEPAGE:p.1361	DESC:When you prepare spells you immediately heal 1 hit point per spell level of domain spells you still have prepared from the previous day. For example, if you did not cast your 2nd-level and 4th-level domain spells the previous day you heal back 6 hit points when preparing your spells.
