Zeal	CATEGORY:Domain	TYPE:Domain	SOURCEPAGE:p.1361	DESC:Once per day you may take 20 on a skill check without increasing the amount of time needed to make the check. You cannot take 20 on checks for which you cannot normally take 20 (such as Balance or Climb checks).|!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Remove Domain Power (Zeal)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Domain Power ~ Zeal|!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Remove Domain Power (Zeal)	ABILITY:Domain|AUTOMATIC|Domain Spells ~ Zeal
Zeal	KEY:Domain Power ~ Zeal	CATEGORY:Domain	TYPE:Domain Power	SOURCEPAGE:p.1361	DESC:Once per day you may take 20 on a skill check without increasing the amount of time needed to make the check. You cannot take 20 on checks for which you cannot normally take 20 (such as Balance or Climb checks).
